    text: "Affected stops:\r\nArapahoe Ave & 16th St (#12201) (eastbound)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 19th St (#12204) (eastbound)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 21st St (#12206) (eastbound)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 21st St (#12205) (westbound)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 19th St (#12203) (westbound)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 17th St (#12202) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound JUMP get on/off buses at:\r\n15th St & Canyon Blvd (#10252)\r\nArapahoe Ave & Folsom St (#19386)\r\n\nFor westbound JUMP get on/off buses at:\r\nArapahoe Ave & 23rd St (#12207)\r\nArapahoe Ave & 14th St (#35049)"
